{"id":9284946,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-ras/merge_requests/129","number":129,"state":"open","title":"fix: validate MatmulAbftVerify inputs and Crypto example","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-ras/pulls/129","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-ras/pulls/129/issues","body":"## 描述\n修复 MatmulAbftVerify 对输出/权重 shape、dtype 组合及 eMax 的输入校验，并修正文档约束；修正 Crypto 示例 API 名称、host buffer 长度检查及 IV 长度。Kernel 数学实现未修改。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n- Fixes #56\n- Fixes #57\n- Fixes #58\n\n## 测试\n- A3 / CANN 9.0：`bash build.sh -u --ops=matmul_abft_verify -j8`，Host 单测 23/23 通过，ACLNN 空指针测试 5/5 通过。\n- A3：`bash build.sh --soc=ascend910_93 --ops=matmul_abft_verify,crypto -j8`，二进制构建成功。\n- A3：Crypto 文档 C++ 示例通过 `g++ -std=c++17 -fsyntax-only`。\n- 未执行 ACLNN 端到端设备调用与量化性能基准；Crypto 示例依赖运行时 KMS/key 环境。当前验证不能作为端到端运行或性能无回退的实测结论。\n\n## 文档更新\n更新 MatmulAbftVerify 中英文 API 文档和 Crypto C++ 示例。\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [x] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：","assignees_number":10,"assignees":[{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880ad5a32fa9627bd89c02f","login":"LiuZonggu","name":"LiuZonggu","avatar_url":"https://cdn-static.gitcode.com/avatars/docs.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/LiuZonggu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822dffae4b985165b4b112b","login":"loov1","name":"loov","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/loov1","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","login":"rxtfeng","name":"rxtfeng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/rxtfeng","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c9d2b3a86414eb5ba3a5","login":"yue-ma","name":"yue-ma","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yue-ma","ass